WEBVTT

00:07.896 --> 00:09.172
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.241 --> 00:10.862
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.931 --> 00:12.344
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.413 --> 00:14.310
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.379 --> 00:17.344
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.413 --> 00:19.448
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.517 --> 00:21.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.517 --> 00:23.344
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.413 --> 00:25.034
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.103 --> 00:27.482
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.551 --> 00:29.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.517 --> 00:31.413
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.482 --> 00:33.448
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.517 --> 00:35.310
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.379 --> 00:37.448
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.517 --> 00:39.551
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.620 --> 00:40.896
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.965 --> 00:42.758
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.827 --> 00:45.482
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.551 --> 00:47.793
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.862 --> 00:49.448
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:53.931 --> 01:01.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:02.965 --> 01:07.000
- [militaristic grunting]
- [军国主义的咕哝声]

01:07.068 --> 01:10.310
Now, we all know
what this day is.
现在，我们都知道
今天是什么日子。

01:10.379 --> 01:12.241
- Today is the day
when Plankton tries to steal
- 今天就是这一天
当浮游生物试图偷窃时

01:12.310 --> 01:13.931
the Krabby Patty formula, sir!
蟹黄派配方，先生！

01:14.000 --> 01:16.275
- Like he does every day.
- 就像他每天所做的那样。

01:16.344 --> 01:19.275
- But this time,
he's not going to catch me
- 但这一次，
他不会抓住我的

01:19.344 --> 01:21.931
with me spatula down!
[laughs]
跟我一起铲下去！
[笑]

01:22.000 --> 01:23.517
Ooh?
[laughs]
哦？
[笑]

01:23.586 --> 01:25.068
SpongeBob
海绵宝宝

01:25.137 --> 01:26.551
you're on guard duty, boy!
你正在值班，孩子！

01:26.620 --> 01:28.034
- Yes, sir, Mr. Krabs!
- 是的，先生，蟹老板！

01:28.103 --> 01:29.965
Yah!
啊！

01:30.034 --> 01:32.517
- And I'll go undercover.
- 我会去卧底。

01:32.586 --> 01:34.517
[snoring]
[打鼾]

01:34.586 --> 01:36.172
- Hm?
- Hut, two, three, four!
- 嗯？
- 小屋，二，三，四！

01:36.241 --> 01:37.758
Hut, two, three, four!
小屋，二，三，四！

01:37.827 --> 01:40.620
♪ Krabby Patties are the best ♪
♪ 蟹肉饼是最好吃的 ♪

01:40.689 --> 01:43.827
♪ They'll put hair
on your chest ♪
♪ 他们会把头发
在你胸口♪

01:43.896 --> 01:45.275
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

01:45.344 --> 01:46.862
Oh!
哦！

01:48.379 --> 01:51.551
- [falteringly]
♪ Krabby Patties are the best ♪
- [支吾其词]
♪ 蟹肉饼是最好吃的 ♪

01:51.620 --> 01:55.310
♪ They'll put hairs...
into your nest ♪
♪ 他们会把头发...
进入你的巢穴♪

01:55.379 --> 01:57.586
- [yawns]
- [哈欠]

01:57.655 --> 02:00.620
Ow.
噢。

02:00.689 --> 02:02.206
- Any sign of Plankton?
- 有浮游生物的迹象吗？

02:02.275 --> 02:03.655
- Uh, afraid not, Mr. Krabs.
- 呃，恐怕不会，蟹老板。

02:03.724 --> 02:05.724
- Maybe he's on vacation.
- 也许他正在度假。

02:05.793 --> 02:06.931
- Don't be silly!
- 别傻了！

02:07.000 --> 02:09.172
We always take
our trips together,
我们总是采取
我们一起旅行，

02:09.241 --> 02:12.551
to keep an eye on each other.
互相关注。

02:12.620 --> 02:14.586
What's taking that crook
so long?
那个骗子怎么了
这么久？

02:14.655 --> 02:16.310
[jaunty accordion music]
[欢快的手风琴音乐]

02:16.379 --> 02:19.586
Hm...
Maybe the door is stuck.
嗯...
也许门被卡住了。

02:19.655 --> 02:22.413
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:22.482 --> 02:23.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:23.965 --> 02:27.206
Ah, for--these customers
are blocking the way!
啊，对于——这些顾客
挡住了路！

02:27.275 --> 02:29.413
[yelling]
[大喊]

02:29.482 --> 02:31.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:31.448 --> 02:33.275
- [sighs]
There we go.
- [叹气]
我们开始吧。

02:33.344 --> 02:35.448
Nice, open path.
不错，开放的道路。

02:35.517 --> 02:38.413
Hm?
Mm...
嗯？
毫米...

02:38.482 --> 02:40.448
Hey!
Well, maybe he just needs
嘿！
好吧，也许他只是需要

02:40.517 --> 02:42.000
a little incentive.
一点激励。

02:42.068 --> 02:43.620
[ukulele music]
[尤克里里音乐]

02:43.689 --> 02:45.379
[fanfare]
[chuckles]
[大张旗鼓]
[笑声]

02:45.448 --> 02:46.586
There we go.
我们开始吧。

02:46.655 --> 02:48.862
[stealthy jazz music]
[隐秘的爵士乐]

02:48.931 --> 02:50.344
Oh.
哦。

02:50.413 --> 02:53.241
Maybe he doesn't want
me formula anymore.
也许他不想
我的公式了。

02:53.310 --> 02:54.344
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:54.413 --> 02:55.931
He took the bait!
他上钩了！

02:56.000 --> 02:58.172
We're going to red alert!
我们要进入红色警报了！

02:58.241 --> 03:00.241
[alarmed music]
[惊慌的音乐]

03:00.310 --> 03:02.103
[hubbub]
[尘嚣]

03:02.172 --> 03:04.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:04.517 --> 03:06.068
Batten down the hatches!
关闭舱门！

03:06.137 --> 03:07.310
Furl the deck!
卷起甲板！

03:07.379 --> 03:10.172
Stop that greedy green goober!
停止那个贪婪的绿色家伙！

03:10.241 --> 03:11.344
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

03:11.413 --> 03:13.517
Oh.
哦。

03:13.586 --> 03:15.413
- [sighs]
Ow.
- [叹气]
噢。

03:15.482 --> 03:19.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:19.413 --> 03:21.827
- Doggone it.
- 完蛋了。

03:21.896 --> 03:23.793
Can I get some ketchup
over here?
我可以买点番茄酱吗
在这里？

03:23.862 --> 03:26.034
Please?
请？

03:26.103 --> 03:27.931
- False alarm.
- 误报。

03:28.000 --> 03:31.172
all: Whoa!
全体：哇！

03:31.241 --> 03:32.862
Oof!
钱币！

03:32.931 --> 03:37.413
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

03:37.482 --> 03:40.896
- Closing time!
- 关门时间！

03:40.965 --> 03:43.896
[jaunty music]
[欢快的音乐]

03:43.965 --> 03:44.896
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:44.965 --> 03:47.068
- And just where
do you think
- 就在哪里
你认为

03:47.137 --> 03:48.689
you two are going?
你们两个要去吗？

03:48.758 --> 03:52.137
- It's customary
to go home at closing time.
- 这是习惯
关门时间回家。

03:52.206 --> 03:53.551
- Aren't you going home,
Mr. Krabs?
- 你不回家吗
蟹老板？

03:53.620 --> 03:55.241
- [laughing]
Oh, I'm not budging.
- [笑]
哦，我不让步。

03:55.310 --> 03:57.103
Plankton is gonna
try something.
浮游生物将会
尝试一些东西。

03:57.172 --> 04:00.275
I don't know when.
I don't know where.
我不知道什么时候。
我不知道在哪里。

04:00.344 --> 04:01.827
- Probably... here.
- 可能...在这里。

04:01.896 --> 04:04.172
- Well, yeah.
But when he does,
- 嗯，是的。
但当他这么做的时候，

04:04.241 --> 04:07.137
I'll be waiting for him.
我会等他。

04:07.206 --> 04:10.689
[laughs]
[笑]

04:10.758 --> 04:14.862
I'll be waiting right here.
我就在这里等着。

04:16.448 --> 04:18.724
- Morning!
Hm?
- 早晨！
嗯？

04:18.793 --> 04:20.517
I guess Mr. Krabs
went home after all.
我猜是蟹老板
毕竟回家了。

04:20.586 --> 04:23.586
- No, I'm still here...
- 不，我还在这里……

04:23.655 --> 04:27.517
Waiting for
that blasted Plankton!
等待
那该死的浮游生物！

04:27.586 --> 04:31.482
both: Gah!
两人：啊！

04:31.551 --> 04:33.827
[disconcerting scales]
[令人不安的尺度]

04:33.896 --> 04:38.034
- Yeah, I'll take--
- Me patty formula?
- 是的，我会接受--
- 我的肉饼配方？

04:38.103 --> 04:39.793
Huh?
I knew it!
啊？
我就知道！

04:39.862 --> 04:42.758
You in there, Plankton?
[grunts angrily]
你在里面吗，浮游生物？
[愤怒地咕哝]

04:42.827 --> 04:46.655
- Mr. Krabs,
that's not Plankton!
- 蟹老板先生，
那不是浮游生物！

04:46.724 --> 04:50.689
- I will never set foot
in this establishment again!
-我永远不会踏足
再次来到这个机构！

04:50.758 --> 04:53.896
From now on,
I'm using the drive-through!
从现在开始，
我用的是直通车！

04:53.965 --> 04:55.241
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

04:55.310 --> 04:56.965
- [humming contentedly]
- [满足地哼哼]

04:57.034 --> 04:58.413
Whoa!
- Aha!
哇！
- 啊哈！

04:58.482 --> 05:01.103
Trying to to sneak
a Krabby Patty to Plankton, eh?
试图偷偷摸摸
蟹肉饼到浮游生物，是吗？

05:01.172 --> 05:04.206
- But Eugene, it's just
a to-go order.
- 但是尤金，这只是
外带订单。

05:04.275 --> 05:06.137
- [mocking gibberish]
- [嘲笑的胡言乱语]

05:06.206 --> 05:09.551
Well, from now on,
all patties are to be eaten
嗯，从现在开始，
所有的肉饼都要吃掉

05:09.620 --> 05:12.689
on the premises!
在现场！

05:12.758 --> 05:15.103
- What are you gonna do now,
ban pockets?
- 你现在要做什么
禁止口袋？

05:15.172 --> 05:18.931
- Capital idea,
Mr. Squidward.
- 资本理念，
章鱼哥先生。

05:19.000 --> 05:23.241
There'll be a $50-a-barrel
surcharge from now on.
每桶价格为 50 美元
即日起加收附加费。

05:23.310 --> 05:24.827
[runaway music]
[失控的音乐]

05:24.896 --> 05:28.482
Whoa, hey,
slow down there, Grampa.
哇，嘿，
慢点儿，爷爷。

05:28.551 --> 05:31.172
Let's just see here.
我们就看这里吧。

05:31.241 --> 05:32.310
Aha!
啊哈！

05:32.379 --> 05:34.793
Another one
of Plankton's spies!
另一个
浮游生物的间谍！

05:34.862 --> 05:37.413
- I just wanted some for later.
- 我只是想要一些供以后使用。

05:37.482 --> 05:39.482
- You're banned!
- 你被禁止了！

05:39.551 --> 05:41.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:41.931 --> 05:43.172
Hm...
嗯...

05:43.241 --> 05:44.931
So Plankton's recruiting
所以 Plankton 的招募

05:45.000 --> 05:48.344
baby burglars now!
现在是小偷了！

05:48.413 --> 05:50.965
- [cries]
- [哭声]

05:51.034 --> 05:52.517
- You're banned!
- 你被禁止了！

05:52.586 --> 05:54.896
You!
You're banned! You're banned!
你！
你被禁止了！你被禁止了！

05:54.965 --> 05:56.689
Banned!
禁止！

05:56.758 --> 05:58.034
- Ah...
- Banned!
- 啊...
- 禁止！

05:58.103 --> 06:00.827
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:00.896 --> 06:02.827
[unhinged string music]
[疯狂的弦乐]

06:02.896 --> 06:06.068
You're all banned!
你们都被禁止了！

06:06.137 --> 06:07.413
[gibbering]
[胡言乱语]

06:07.482 --> 06:09.689
- Mr. Krabs, I don't think
Plankton's coming.
- 蟹老板先生，我不认为
浮游生物来了

06:09.758 --> 06:10.724
- Nonsense.
- 废话。

06:10.793 --> 06:12.068
[knocking]
[gasps]
[敲门声]
[喘气]

06:12.137 --> 06:15.586
See?
It's that stinker Plankton now.
看？
现在是那个臭浮游生物了。

06:15.655 --> 06:17.310
What do you want?
你想要什么？

06:17.379 --> 06:19.724
- Uh...
A Krabby Patty?
- 呃...
蟹肉饼？

06:19.793 --> 06:22.379
- Why?
- I'm hungry.
- 为什么？
- 我饿了。

06:22.448 --> 06:24.862
- Mr. Krabs, that's just Sandy.
- 蟹老板，那是桑迪。

06:24.931 --> 06:26.413
- I'm not falling for it.
- 我不会上当的。

06:26.482 --> 06:29.172
That's the worst squirrel suit
I've ever seen.
这是最差的松鼠套装
我曾经见过。

06:29.241 --> 06:30.620
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

06:30.689 --> 06:32.000
[ukulele music]
[尤克里里音乐]

06:32.068 --> 06:34.758
[gibbering]
[胡言乱语]

06:34.827 --> 06:37.689
- Do you think Mr. Krabs
is acting... strange?
- 你认为蟹老板先生
行为……很奇怪吗？

06:37.758 --> 06:43.379
- [manic gibbering, laughter]
- [狂躁的胡言乱语，笑声]

06:43.448 --> 06:45.206
- He seems fine to me.
- 他对我来说似乎很好。

06:45.275 --> 06:46.724
- Maybe we should postpone
-也许我们应该推迟

06:46.793 --> 06:48.310
our plans for tonight.
我们今晚的计划。

06:48.379 --> 06:50.206
- Plans?
Aha!
- 计划？
啊哈！

06:50.275 --> 06:52.551
You're both working
for Plankton!
你们俩都在工作
为了浮游生物！

06:52.620 --> 06:53.896
Get out of me restaurant,
滚出我的餐厅，

06:53.965 --> 06:56.275
you tricky treacherous
traitors!
你这个狡猾奸诈的人
叛徒！

06:56.344 --> 06:58.517
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

06:58.586 --> 07:00.379
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

07:00.448 --> 07:03.137
- I know you're in here,
Plankton.
- 我知道你在这里
浮游生物。

07:03.206 --> 07:05.758
Where you hiding?
你躲哪儿了？

07:05.827 --> 07:08.379
- I'm right here
- 我就在这里

07:08.448 --> 07:09.551
at the Chum Bucket!
在密友桶里！

07:09.620 --> 07:10.758
Come on down
下来吧

07:10.827 --> 07:12.551
and try our new Chum Nuggets.
并尝试我们新推出的 Chum Nuggets。

07:12.620 --> 07:14.275
- Heh.
Whew.
- 呵呵。
呼。

07:14.344 --> 07:16.241
[screams]
[尖叫声]

07:16.310 --> 07:17.931
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

07:18.000 --> 07:19.482
Oh.
[chuckles]
哦。
[笑声]

07:19.551 --> 07:22.275
Just a--just a cup.
只是一个——只是一个杯子。

07:22.344 --> 07:25.482
- [laughs]
- [笑]

07:25.551 --> 07:26.862
- Ah!
Oh?
- 啊！
哦？

07:26.931 --> 07:30.344
[maniacal laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

07:30.413 --> 07:31.586
Ah!
啊!

07:31.655 --> 07:34.620
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

07:34.689 --> 07:37.068
[screams]
[尖叫声]

07:37.137 --> 07:39.724
[gibbering]
[胡言乱语]

07:39.793 --> 07:44.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:44.413 --> 07:45.379
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:45.448 --> 07:48.310
[screams]
[尖叫声]

07:48.379 --> 07:50.517
Get ahold of yourself.
Get ahold of yourself.
把握好自己。
把握好自己。

07:50.586 --> 07:53.517
[sighs]
[叹气]

07:53.586 --> 07:56.275
I'm starting to see things.
[laughs]
我开始看清事情了。
[笑]

07:56.344 --> 07:59.896
[maniacal laughter]
[疯狂的笑声]

07:59.965 --> 08:06.586
- [screams, gibbers]
- [尖叫声，胡言乱语]

08:06.655 --> 08:08.620
Huh?
啊？

08:08.689 --> 08:11.586
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

08:11.655 --> 08:12.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:12.793 --> 08:14.310
Those two ARE
那两个是

08:14.379 --> 08:16.655
working for Plankton!
为浮游生物工作！

08:16.724 --> 08:18.793
[gasps]
[喘气]

08:18.862 --> 08:21.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:21.586 --> 08:23.241
- Ow.
- 噢。

08:23.310 --> 08:25.206
- Me own daughter?
- 我自己的女儿？

08:25.275 --> 08:26.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:27.034 --> 08:31.103
Oh, not Old Man Jenkins!
哦，不是老詹金斯！

08:31.172 --> 08:34.827
[cries]
[哭声]

08:38.137 --> 08:40.655
Everyone really is
out to get you.
大家确实是
出来找你。

08:40.724 --> 08:42.275
Aren't they, my little formula?
不是吗，我的小公式？

08:42.344 --> 08:44.034
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

08:45.482 --> 08:46.862
- Mr. Krabs?
- 蟹老板？

08:46.931 --> 08:48.517
[stiltedly] You have got
to come with me
[生硬地]你已经得到了
跟我来

08:48.586 --> 08:50.586
to... The Chum Bucket,
到...密友桶，

08:50.655 --> 08:52.793
for Plankton
has kidnapped Squidward.
对于浮游生物
绑架了章鱼哥。

08:52.862 --> 08:55.275
- Oh, so that's
Plankton's evil plan?
- 哦，原来如此
浮游生物的邪恶计划？

08:55.344 --> 08:57.758
He wants me formula
as ransom!
他要我配方
作为赎金！

08:57.827 --> 08:59.724
What do we do?
我们该怎么办？

08:59.793 --> 09:01.482
What?
What's that?
什么？
那是什么？

09:01.551 --> 09:04.655
Oh, that's just brilliant!
哦，那真是太棒了！

09:04.724 --> 09:06.655
Hold on a minute.
等一下。

09:06.724 --> 09:10.241
I'll go get the ransom.
我去拿赎金。

09:10.310 --> 09:12.862
Oh, you want a Krabby Patty,
do you?
哦，你想要一个蟹肉饼，
你呢？

09:12.931 --> 09:15.448
Well, I'll give you
a Krabby Patty.
嗯，我给你
蟹肉饼。

09:15.517 --> 09:22.068
[laughs maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

09:22.137 --> 09:23.517
Oh!
哦！

09:23.586 --> 09:24.793
Ooh?
哦？

09:24.862 --> 09:26.793
[laughs evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

09:26.862 --> 09:29.448
Okay, let's go
rescue Squidward.
好吧，我们走吧
营救章鱼哥。

09:29.517 --> 09:32.689
[laughs]
[笑]

09:32.758 --> 09:35.655
[mysterious orchestral music]
【神秘的管弦乐】

09:35.724 --> 09:39.275
- [muffled speech]
- [低声说话]

09:39.344 --> 09:40.655
- [laughs evilly]
- [邪恶地笑]

09:40.724 --> 09:42.896
Surprised, Krabs?
蟹蟹们，惊讶吗？

09:42.965 --> 09:44.965
- Not at all, Sheldon.
- 一点也不，谢尔顿。

09:45.034 --> 09:46.758
I knew you were
up to something.
我知道你是
做某事。

09:46.827 --> 09:48.448
- Oh, yeah?
- 哦，是吗？

09:48.517 --> 09:50.241
How about now?
现在怎么样？

09:50.310 --> 09:51.827
all: Surprise!
全体：惊喜！

09:51.896 --> 09:53.206
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

09:53.275 --> 09:54.448
[confused noises]
[混乱的声音]

09:54.517 --> 09:56.137
- Oh, come, Krabs.
- 哦，来吧，蟹蟹。

09:56.206 --> 09:58.034
It's the anniversary
of the first time
这是周年纪念日
第一次

09:58.103 --> 10:00.724
I tried to steal
your Krabby Patty formula!
我试图偷窃
你的蟹黄派配方！

10:00.793 --> 10:03.310
- So we threw you
a surprise party.
- 所以我们把你扔了
一个惊喜派对。

10:03.379 --> 10:06.551
- You mean you weren't
working for Plankton?
- 你的意思是你不是
为浮游生物工作？

10:06.620 --> 10:08.206
- Of course not, Mr. Krabs.
- 当然不是，蟹老板。

10:08.275 --> 10:12.034
- Oh, I shouldn't have
suspected you, SpongeBob.
- 哦，我不应该
怀疑你了，海绵宝宝。

10:12.103 --> 10:14.724
Whew.
Won't need these anymore.
呼。
不再需要这些了。

10:14.793 --> 10:16.620
[laughs]
[笑]

10:16.689 --> 10:18.827
- Oh, boy, Krabby Patties!
- 哦，天哪，蟹肉饼！

10:18.896 --> 10:19.896
- Yee-haw!
- 哎呀！

10:19.965 --> 10:21.724
[excited hubbub]
[兴奋的喧哗]

10:21.793 --> 10:24.586
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

10:24.655 --> 10:25.758
No!
Don't eat the patties!
不！
别吃肉饼！

10:25.827 --> 10:27.103
- Huh?
- Gotcha.
- 啊？
- 明白了。

10:27.172 --> 10:28.206
[laughs]
[笑]

10:28.275 --> 10:29.586
[gibbers]
[胡言乱语]

10:29.655 --> 10:33.310
[energetic music]
[充满活力的音乐]

10:33.379 --> 10:35.310
Ah!
啊!

10:35.379 --> 10:40.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:40.482 --> 10:42.724
Whew.
呼。

10:42.793 --> 10:45.068
Ah, tartar sauce!
啊，塔塔酱！

10:45.137 --> 10:47.275
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:47.344 --> 10:48.758
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:48.827 --> 10:54.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:54.551 --> 10:57.379
[all oohing]
[全都欢呼]

10:57.448 --> 11:01.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:02.586 --> 11:04.482
Yay.
耶。

11:04.551 --> 11:07.482
[ukulele music]
[尤克里里音乐]

11:07.551 --> 11:08.689
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:08.758 --> 11:10.862
[excited chatter]
[兴奋的喋喋不休]

11:10.931 --> 11:12.241
- A little help here!
- 这里有一点帮助！

11:12.310 --> 11:14.724
- Did you enjoy
the surprise party, Mr. Krabs?
- 你喜欢吗
蟹老板，惊喜派对？

11:14.793 --> 11:18.172
- Eh, I'll tell you
in a second.
- 呃，我告诉你
一秒钟。

11:18.241 --> 11:20.724
- [grunts]
Huh?
- [咕哝]
啊？

11:20.793 --> 11:22.344
[angelic chorus]
[天使合唱]

11:22.413 --> 11:24.758
Ooh, that fool Krabs
哦，螃蟹那个傻瓜

11:24.827 --> 11:27.689
left the Krabby Patty formula
behind!
留下了蟹黄派的配方
落后了！

11:27.758 --> 11:31.793
[chuckles]
[笑声]

11:31.862 --> 11:33.896
[nervous vocalization]
Mommy.
[紧张发声]
妈妈。

11:33.965 --> 11:36.034
[ukulele music]
[尤克里里音乐]

11:36.103 --> 11:37.206
Ooh.
哦。

11:37.275 --> 11:40.827
- Yes, boyo.
I enjoyed it very much.
- 是的，男孩。
我非常喜欢它。

11:40.896 --> 11:44.206
[laughs]
[笑]

[笑]